{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_07",
  "title": "永恒绚烂的藏品",
  "storyCode": "SS-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "01d33ef1020cc7c181ed993ed016f4155ef03bdd5ee835a0aace188a56a4ad83",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈，稍等我一下好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们还好吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......还好还好，就是屁股有点痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚不是还见到了爱丽丝小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......唔......唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "麦草垛的深处传来一阵熟悉的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......快把爱丽丝挖出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（大口喘气）差......差点就要闷死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不是还要收集孩子们的愿望吗？为什么会出现在这？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，工作比想象中顺利得多。这边的孩子们意外地乖巧，所以就提前结束啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本来是想体验体验在乡间开车的感觉，没想到半路出了毛病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也修理过这种载具，我们赶紧一起把它修好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，也不知道今天是幸运还是倒霉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来我还有些担心哪里会出状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到今天的工作出奇地顺利，更没想到的是，会在这种小事上出现意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿能尽快修好吧......这样今晚就能返程了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚返程......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子转身看向身后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在不远处，母亲正微笑地看着她和她的伙伴们。\n她发觉了女儿回眸的视线，于是轻轻地点了点头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......你的母亲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们长得真像，尤其是眼睛和嘴巴，给人一种既温柔又坚定的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可是我并不坚定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么这么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爱丽丝小姐，你是仙女对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仙女会倾听人的愿望，然后将愿望在梦中化为短暂的“现实”......对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是如果，真的有人在梦境中无法自拔，那又该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真正的仙女，是不会允许这样的事情发生的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "待在梦里的时间过长，最后只会让人分辨不清现实和梦境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果她一直不苏醒呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，最严重的结果从来不是无法苏醒，而是将梦中的一切当作理所应当后，却在某一刻醒来，发现经历的一切全是泡影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在梦中度过了无比幸福的一生后，却发现自己又回到了现实，一切又回到了原点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年幼的躯体，苍老的灵魂。梦中的一切都无法抓住，从此只能孑然一身地行于世间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的梦，真的是好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本该失败的事，就不应靠梦境去逃避；本该错过的人，就应该好好地说声再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子再次转身看向身后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像说得有些多了......是不是耽误你们母女相聚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没有的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，曾经有一个对我而言很重要的人，也问过我同样的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时的我没有给出坚决的答案，最后酿成了无可挽回的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才会这么在意这件事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "载具终于修好啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红豆，你别碰了！千万别碰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们快些上去吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子小姐，你会跟我们一起回去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子又一次看向了身后的“母亲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“母亲”依然在那里站着，似乎在等待着什么。\n在等待她的许诺？还是她的宣判？\n她只是一直站在那，对自己的女儿报以最温柔的微笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系的，祥子。你就在家里多待一段时间吧，你最近这么累，也该休休假了。我会和人事部那边打好招呼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g6_sakikopianoroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再试试——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，就先到这里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已经很累了吧，我们来沏点红茶，再慢慢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是因为太紧张了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如我们来聊聊天吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才那些人，是祥子的朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，大家都是罗德岛的同事，也都是很好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，是一家医药公司，有一艘巨大的陆行舰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_0_rhodes3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们在舰船上工作和生活，去往这个世界的任何地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g6_sakikopianoroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......世界？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......泰拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是有意思的说法呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛上，有能供人练琴的琴房吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有，巡航期间没有那么多娱乐活动，很多干员都会玩些乐器来打发时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有时也会在宿舍里用便携电子琴弹两首曲子。红豆还会组建自己的乐队——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那祥子有组建自己的乐队吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是和红豆小姐一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的，是和其他人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈有点好奇，和祥子一起组乐队的人会是什么样的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一个虽然总和我意见不合，但是很有上进心的努力派鼓手，我们比起朋友，更像是战友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一个技术高超的贝斯手，总是认真地为大家做好日程管理之类的幕后工作，作为工作伙伴十分值得信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一个擅长作词的吉他手兼主唱，她明明还有自己的偶像工作要做，但即使忙碌，也一直支持着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有一位吉他手，我们从小就是很好的朋友，在......在我离开家一个人时，总会陪着我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听起来，你们是一个亲密无间的团体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，实际上我们总是吵架，甚至乐队还解散过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你们现在有和好如初吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和她们走散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她们在很远很远的地方，我没法去到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有多远？从维多利亚到乌萨斯？还是更远？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g6_sakikopianoroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么犹豫了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为......因为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我害怕我去找她们的话，就要离开你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我害怕再也见不到你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻孩子，我一直都在呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，你不是离开我了吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g6_sakikopianoroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g5_srcpark"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g2_jindastreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g6_sakikopianoroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "温暖的体温，真切的呼吸。\n妈妈温柔地注视着祥子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，祥子......妈妈对你撒谎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早就知道，我不是你真正的妈妈了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，妈妈一直在小心地维护着这个小小的谎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实我根本没有参加过你的高中入学典礼。在你问我以前，我记忆中的你还是一个初中生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我也不知为何，最近我眼里的祥子，即使在开心地笑着，身边依然萦绕着一层阴云......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，从什么时候开始，会有这样的表情了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我不知道的这段时间里，你到底经历了什么痛苦呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，关于这些，妈妈都一无所知。我唯一知晓的是，在你最痛苦的时候，我却没能陪伴在你的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，能见到你，妈妈真的、真的很开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈真的、真的很想看着你长大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也很想站在台下，亲眼看看你的演出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你新认识的那些朋友......我也很想见见她们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈很贪心，想知道关于你的一切，想一直陪伴在你的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但正因为我是你的妈妈，正因为我深爱着你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以才想让你离开这里，去寻找你自己真正的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，离开吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回到你的“世界”去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奔涌的情感终于止不住地决堤，祥子将头埋入母亲的怀中，嚎啕大哭。\n而母亲只是轻拍女儿的背，喃喃地安抚，就像她以前经常做的那样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g5_sakikodininghall"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“父亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？祥子，你又要出门吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子接下来有重要的事要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“父亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这才回家多久，不能再多留一会吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“母亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......亲爱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“父亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“父亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，我已经和你妈妈统一战线了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“父亲”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哭腔）就是......就是......你在外面一定要记得好好吃饭哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我知道啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......我就出门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲&父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲&父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，一路顺风——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
